  "notes": "Smoke-only startup and shutdown responsiveness correction. A confirmed power-on hold now latches the battery frame at full brightness before BLE/NVS initialization, and normal runtime no longer waits for the cosmetic battery animation; the safety probe and status transition remain active but complete in about 450 ms. Manual shutdown keeps the existing one-second intent guard and extends the final visible fade by exactly 500 ms, from 250 to 750 ms. BLE shutdown, persistence, wake-source setup and original-button release handling now all finish before that fade, so the device enters deep sleep immediately after the LEDs go black and a new held Wake press can wake it without a hidden dead interval. Battery fade staggering now follows only the LEDs that are actually active. BLE protocol and Twin Button firmware content are unchanged.",
